/* 首次及再次查看的 Finder/Services 引导 */
"Using GoGrip from Finder" = "在 Finder 中使用 GoGrip";
"In Finder, select one or more folders or Markdown files, then choose Services → Open with GoGrip from the context menu; the preview opens in your default browser." = "在 Finder 中选中一个或多个目录或 Markdown 文件，然后从右键菜单的“服务”子菜单中选择“用 GoGrip 打开”；预览会在默认浏览器中打开。";
"If the command is not there, check System Settings → Keyboard → Keyboard Shortcuts… → Services and make sure GoGrip's service is enabled." = "如果菜单里没有这个命令，请打开“系统设置”→“键盘”→“键盘快捷键…”→“服务”，确认 GoGrip 的服务已启用。";
"GoGrip opens what macOS allows it to access. Ordinary targets need no extra permission; if macOS asks while opening a target, allow the GoGrip app to access it under Privacy & Security → Files and Folders." = "GoGrip 只能打开 macOS 允许它访问的内容；普通目标无需额外授权。如果打开目标时系统询问，请在“隐私与安全性”→“文件与文件夹”中允许 GoGrip 访问。";
"You can also open a target from this panel with Open…, and reopen this guide any time with Help." = "也可以在本面板中点“打开…”选择目标；之后随时点“帮助”可再次查看本说明。";

